---
/**
 * About.astro - "Who We Are" Section
 * 
 * Cleaned up and modernized editorial layout:
 * - Removed overline badge and philosophy callout box for a clean, uncluttered presentation.
 * - Cleaned image presentation: removed all floating cards, tags, and metadata overlays.
 * - Single, perfectly styled "READ MORE ->" button harmonized with the site's primary button design system.
 * - Restrained typography, generous whitespace, and subtle entrance motion.
 */
---

<section id="who-we-are" class="py-16 sm:py-20 lg:py-24 bg-white relative overflow-hidden scroll-mt-20" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
  <!-- Subtle technical grid background accent -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-fed-grid-light opacity-50 pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      
      <!-- Left Column: Clean Architectural Image Presentation -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex justify-center reveal-on-scroll">
        <div class="relative w-full max-w-lg">
          <div class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-slate-200/80 bg-slate-50 group">
            <img
              src="/images/2.jpg"
              alt="Unity Compass Strategic Federal Proposal and Advisory Workspace"
              class="w-full h-auto object-cover transform transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-[1.02]"
              loading="lazy"
              width="640"
              height="480"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Editorial Structured Narrative -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6 reveal-on-scroll delay-100">
        
        <!-- Main Section Heading with 1st letter in Brand Red -->
        <h2 id="about-heading" class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#0C487A] tracking-tight leading-tight">
          <span class="text-[#FF3130]">W</span>ho We Are
        </h2>

        <!-- Structured Core Paragraphs with Verbatim Content and Interactive Links -->
        <div class="space-y-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-700 leading-relaxed font-normal">
          <p>
            Unity Compass is a government contracting consulting and staffing firm dedicated to helping commercial businesses and federal contractors compete, qualify, and perform in complex federal environments.
          </p>

          <p>
            We specialize in <a href="/proposal-development-services" class="link-hover-expand font-semibold text-[#0C487A] hover:text-[#FF3130] transition-colors">proposal development</a>, <a href="/customized-support-services" class="link-hover-expand font-semibold text-[#0C487A] hover:text-[#FF3130] transition-colors">OASIS+ readiness support</a>, cleared and non-cleared recruitment, staffing solutions, and <a href="/information-technology-and-business-consulting" class="link-hover-expand font-semibold text-[#0C487A] hover:text-[#FF3130] transition-colors">IT & program consulting</a>.
          </p>

          <p>
            Our approach is structured, compliance-driven, and built around defensible documentation, because in federal contracting, precision determines outcomes.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Refined Action: Single Primary Button Aligned to Design System -->
        <div class="pt-2">
          <a
            href="javascript:void(0)"
            class="btn-outline-transition-navy group inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider shadow-sm active:scale-[0.98] cursor-pointer"
          >
            <span>Read More</span>
            <svg
              class="w-4 h-4 transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:translate-x-1.5"
              fill="none"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              stroke="currentColor"
            >
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
